<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Invalid or Expired Token</title>
</head>
<body style="display: flex; height: 100vh; justify-content: center; align-items: center; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;">
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 20px; text-align: center; background-color: #f44336; color: #ffffff;">
                <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px;">Invalid or Expired Token</h1>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 20px;">
                <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333;">
                    Hello,
                </p>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333;">
                    We’re sorry, but the token you used to reset your password is either invalid or has expired. 
                </p>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333;">
                    If you still need to reset your password, please request a new password reset link.
                </p>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333;">
                    Thank you,<br>
                    The Support Team
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 10px; text-align: center; background-color: #f4f4f4; color: #777;">
                <small style="font-size: 12px;">&copy; 2024 Your Company. All rights reserved.</small>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
